        "August: males sum 717 vs printed 717; females sum 291 vs printed 291; printed M+F 1008 vs printed combined 1,008",
        "September: males sum 752 vs printed 742 — does NOT reconcile (diff +10); females sum 299 vs printed 299; printed M+F 1041 vs printed combined 1,041",
        "October: males sum 817 vs printed 717 — does NOT reconcile (diff +100); females sum 291 vs printed 291; printed M+F 1008 vs printed combined 1,008",
        "Cells re-read at high zoom and confirmed as printed: January American Female 120; June Indian Male 77; September Swiss Male 13; October Japanese Male 111 (these account for the diffs of +110, +70, +10, +100 respectively, apparently printer errors). July Female diff +4 not traced to a single cell."
      ],
